                        <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>Total<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span></span>
                    </p>
                </td>
                <td width=110 valign=top style='width:82.6pt;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                    <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:center'>
                        <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black;text-transform:uppercase'>125<o:p></o:p></span>
                    </p>
                </td>
                <td width=366 valign=top style='width:274.55pt;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
                    <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-bottom:6.0pt;text-align:center'>
                        <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black;text-transform:uppercase'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span>
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:.25in;text-align:justify'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                Number of plots may increase or decrease depending on the
                availability of the land.
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black;text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5in;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo21;tab-stops:list .25in'>
            <![if !supportLists]><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                    <span style='mso-list:Ignore'>
                        4.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
                    </span>
                </span>
            </b><![endif]><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Following shall be the criteria to
                determine application under reservation/expansion category.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:.55in;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.3in;mso-list:l5 level2 lfo21;tab-stops:list .55in'>
            <![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-list:Ignore'>
                    4.1.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
                    </span>
                </span>
            </span><![endif]><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                For
                existing Noida allottees <o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;tab-stops:45.0pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(i)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-tab-count:1'>  </span>Only
                those applicants who have a definite PAN Number are eligible to apply. Application
                forms indicating no PAN Number or “PAN Number applied for” would be summarily
                rejected.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(ii)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-tab-count:1'>  </span>Existing
                noida allottee(s), who have fully utilized their existing industrial
                property/properties for the permitted industrial purpose, may apply.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(iii)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-tab-count:1'> </span>Existing
                noida allottee(s)/transferee(s) of unused/partly utilized existing industrial
                property are not eligible to apply.
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                Allottee(s) who have been issued notice
                against unauthorized use of their industrial premise
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;color:black'>
                s are also not
                eligible to apply
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'><o:p></o:p></span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                    (iv)<span style='mso-tab-count:1'></span>
                </span>
            </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Noida
                allottee(s)/ transferee(s) who have transferred/ partly changed the
                constitution of industrial property outside specified family members are not
                eligible to apply. However in cases of 100% CIC in one go, being at par with
                transfer cases are eligible to apply.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                    (v)<span style='mso-tab-count:1'></span>
                </span>
            </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                The functional units of NOIDA who have been allotted plots in earlier
                reserve/expansion category scheme(s) by draw of plots are not eligible to get a
                plot under reservation/expansion.<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>


        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                    (vi)<span style='mso-tab-count:1'></span>
                </span>
            </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Noida entrepreneurs who have transferred their original plot and
                further purchased an industrial plot of bigger size from open market are
                eligible to apply, provided the new unit has been declared functional by the
                authority before opening date of the scheme.<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                    (vii)<span style='mso-tab-count:1'></span>
                </span>
            </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Only one application shall be entertained from a unit declared
                functional.
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;color:black'>
                The applicant may be sole proprietor/partner in case of
                partnership firm/director in case of a company
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>or respective spouse/children</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;color:black'>.</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                In case where more than one application
                is received against one unit in same constitution, only one application shall
                be entertained.<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(viii)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Subject to above and the cases where no
                renting exists, 33% of the plots available in this scheme are reserved for
                functional units, its proprietor (s)/ partners(s)/director(s)/share holder(s)
                and their spouse/ children.<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(ix)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Existing noida allottee(s) whose existing
                unit has been in production for the last 5 years and has been declared
                functional by NOIDA are eligible to apply. Allottee has to submit a No Dues
                Certificate from AO(IAA) at the time of submission of application form.<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(x)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>Under
                expansion category application from any one partner/spouse/children, no
                objection certificate from other partners shall be required. In case of application(s)
                from any of the director/spouse/children, resolution passed by the company
                shall be required.<span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:42.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.25pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xi)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Transfer/change in constitution outside
                specified family members, as per Industrial Policy and Procedure 2012, will not
                be permitted for 05 years w.e.f. the date of allotment of plot allotted under
                expansion category of this scheme. <span style='text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xii)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                Existing noida
                allottee(s) who have fully utilized the existing industrial property/properties
                for permitted industrial purpose may apply
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>but</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                shall be considered under expansion/reserve category subject to
                condition that they have not closed/shut down their industrial unit and have
                not rented their industrial plot premises. Applicants shall submit an affidavit
                ion this regard. Such allottees, who have defaulted against their dues to the
                Authority shall not be eligible under expansion category.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Violation any of the above (i)/(ii)/(iii)/(iv)/(v)/(vi)/(vii)/(vii)/(viii)/(ix)/(x)/(xi)/(xii)
                by the applicant/allottee may lead to cancellation of allotment of plot, if any
                and in these case the deposited amount will be forfeited irrespective of the
                status/stage of the case.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Conditions from (i) to (xii) shall apply to applicants who already
                own an industrial plot in NOIDA.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'>
            <br clear=all style='page-break-before:always'>
        </span>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:35.45pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                4.2<span style='mso-tab-count:1'> </span><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                    For industries which have obtained rent
                    permission from NOIDA.<o:p></o:p>
                </b>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xiii)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Those industries who have obtained rent
                permission from Noida Industrial Department to run their business in their favor,
                are also eligible to apply under reservation/expansion category. Such
                applicants shall be required to submit a copy of such permission along with
                their application. In case the applicants fail to submit the rent permission
                letter, the application for allotment under this scheme as liable be cancelled
                and deposited amount shall be forfeited irrespective of the status/stage of the
                case.
            </span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:black'> <o:p></o:p></span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                    <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'></span>(
                </span>
            </b><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>xiv</span></b><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>)</span>
            </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                If an industry has obtained a valid rent permission from
                the authority to run its business, applications o
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>f</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>such applicant</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>s</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                shall be considered under reserved/expansion category. Incase the
                land is not allotted under reserved/expansion category, such application
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>s</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>s</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>hall be</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>considered again under General category of plot allotment.</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'><o:p></o:p></span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-4.5pt'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>Conditions
                from (xiii) to
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>(</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>xiv</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>)</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                shall apply to applicants who have
                obtained rent permission from NOIDA.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        

        <span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'>
            <br clear=all style='page-break-before:always'>
        </span>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-13.5pt'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                4.3 <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                    For
                    industries applying under start up category<o:p></o:p>
                </b>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:49.65pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                <span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>(xv)</span>
            </b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>Applications for <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>start up firms</b> shall be considered separately.
                The other eligibility conditions for such firms shall be under
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>the</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                guidelines issued for Start-up firms
                from the Government time to time.
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Applicants under this category shall furnish a certificate
                regarding their consideration under startup based on their industry norms.
                Applicants should apply for only those projects which are covered under
                Industrial Policy &amp; Procedure Oct 2012 as per Annexure III. Additionally
                please refer to point 6 while submitting project report. <o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:49.65pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xvi)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                5 plots in plot area 450 sq.mtr. category
                and 5 plots in <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>plot area 1000 sq.mtr.
                category have been reserved for startup firms. <o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:49.65pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xvii)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                Amongst these plots, a draw shall be made
                to allot plot against the applications received under this category.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:49.65pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xviii</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                ) If the applications received are less
                than the plots available, then plots left after the draw shall be made available
                under open ended scheme for start up firms.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:49.65pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-28.35pt'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>(xix)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                If the applications received are greater
                than the plots available, then unsuccessful applicants after the manual draw
                will be considered again
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                under General category of plot allotment, provided they
                meet the e
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                ligibility for
                general category plots. <o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:21.3pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-4.5pt'>
            <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>Conditions
                from
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                (xv)
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
                to (xix) shall apply to
                applicants applying under start up firms category.<o:p></o:p>
            </span>
        </p>

        <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:6.0pt;margin-left:40.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in'>
            <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>(xx)</span></b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>
                    For plots are measuring area greater than
                    4000 sq.mtr
                </b>: incase the number of applications for this category exceeds
                the number of plots available, the applicants shall be invited for a screening
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>in person</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                before the Screening Committee.
                The Screening Committee shal
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>l</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                then recommend
                the
            </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'> selected</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;color:black'>
                applicants for
                land/plot allotment after examining their applications.
            </span><span style='font-size:15.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;color:black'>
                <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'></span><o:p></o:p>
